em"><div class="company-sticky_logo-embed"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/690a2dd97789db85e2dbd2fc_2357d43277b288f2be6a84d56c3cfdbf_morpho-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto-height"/></div></div><div class="company-sticky_logo-item"><div class="company-sticky_logo-embed"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67f63e2b1bcdf9ee93ebecb2_logo-sky.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto-height"/></div></div><div class="company-sticky_logo-item"><div class="company-sticky_logo-embed"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d1d93dde90569fd5b165ba_aave.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto-height"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_home-why"><div class="section_video"><div class="container-large is-70rem"><div class="padding-section-large is-1px-border"><div class="home-why_component"><div class="w-layout-vflex home-why_top"><div class="w-layout-grid home-why_top-left"><div class="max-width width-45rem"><div class="home-why_top-content"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">Why Centrifuge?</h2><p class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Centrifuge powers institutional-grade tokenization with automated infrastructure, multichain reach, and deep DeFi connectivity.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid home-why_grid"><div hover-card="" class="home-why_card"><div class="home-why_card-img-wrap"><img id="w-node-c01d8c8b-c32f-e962-a8b0-08a3d2ca645f-e537ffd6" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 683px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/670e6e788493211ac3138f1d_image-wrapper.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/670e6e788493211ac3138f1d_image-wrapper-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/670e6e788493211ac3138f1d_image-wrapper.webp 683w" class="layout251_image"/><img class="layout251_image-hover" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d43d044743c3192ad_home-why-1.webp" alt="" hover-element="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 50vw" id="w-node-c9413872-85bb-6900-410d-2c4ce0df198f-e537ffd6" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d43d044743c3192ad_home-why-1-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d43d044743c3192ad_home-why-1-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d43d044743c3192ad_home-why-1.webp 1366w"/></div><div class="w-layout-vflex home-why_card-content"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Institutional yield products</h3><p class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Tokenize and manage any type of asset - self-serve or via our whiteglove services.</p></div></div><div hover-card="" class="home-why_card"><div class="home-why_card-img-wrap"><img id="w-node-ae45c8f9-97b8-ebfc-8718-27fe4ef00c59-e537ffd6" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 683px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712569a0054dba92e3acb29_image-wrapper-2.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712569a0054dba92e3acb29_image-wrapper-2-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712569a0054dba92e3acb29_image-wrapper-2.webp 683w" class="layout251_image"/><img class="layout251_image-hover" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6c43c97f2c868b1a_home-why-2.webp" alt="" hover-element="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 50vw" id="w-node-c1ef4b24-d360-6ff1-c70a-d10ad2da4737-e537ffd6" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6c43c97f2c868b1a_home-why-2-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6c43c97f2c868b1a_home-why-2-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6c43c97f2c868b1a_home-why-2.webp 1366w"/></div><div class="w-layout-vflex home-why_card-content"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Seamless DeFi connectivity</h3><p class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Access liquidity and secondary markets through integrations across DeFi.</p></div></div><div hover-card="" class="home-why_card"><div class="home-why_card-img-wrap"><img id="w-node-_08b58fca-1225-5c14-4bb4-bd8a5cbbb873-e537ffd6" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 684px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712569adab6f91526cc89ba_image-wrapper-3.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712569adab6f91526cc89ba_image-wrapper-3-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712569adab6f91526cc89ba_image-wrapper-3.webp 684w" class="layout251_image"/><img class="layout251_image-hover" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6e212bd89ce450eb_home-why-3.webp" alt="" hover-element="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 50vw" id="w-node-_94726fe3-4fa3-d9a2-0cb5-db11cc9d64de-e537ffd6" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6e212bd89ce450eb_home-why-3-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6e212bd89ce450eb_home-why-3-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/6712932d6e212bd89ce450eb_home-why-3.webp 1366w"/></div><div class="w-layout-vflex home-why_card-content"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Experienced and trusted team</h3><p class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Led by finance and tech pioneers with a proven track record of building high-adoption businesses</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section_testimonial"><div class="section_video"><div class="container-large is-70rem"><div class="padding-section-medium border-1px"><div class="testimonial_wrap"><div class="swiper is-testimonial"><div class="swiper-wrapper is-testimonial"><div class="swiper-slide is-testimonial"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="display-mobile-landscape-v2"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2c2b2c9692ccb4ecdc5ba_janus-henderson-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex max-width-large align-center"><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium"><span class="text-color-primary">Collaboration with Centrifuge and Anemoy represents a significant step forward in bridging traditional and decentralized finance</span><span class="text-color-secondary"> by bringing robust institutional collateral pools into the decentralized autonomous organization and stablecoin ecosystems.</span></p></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left"><div class="w-layout-vflex testimonial_card-bottom_left_img-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67cf0c0db31741f967017056_nick-cherney.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_card-bottom_left_img"/></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left-name"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Nick Cherney</div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Head of Innovation at Janus Henderson</div></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_middle-line"></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right hide-mobile-landscape"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2c2b2c9692ccb4ecdc5ba_janus-henderson-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto logo-janus"/></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide is-testimonial"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="display-mobile-landscape-v2"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd73ceaf885fdd89983b_blocktower-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex max-width-large align-center"><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Blockchain technology has a long-held promise to overhaul the plumbing of the world’s financial services.<span class="text-color-secondary"> To this end, BlockTower is excited to support the Centrifuge team as they democratize access to and generate efficiencies in the securitization industry; we believe these strategic partnerships are essential to usher in the future of finance.</span></p></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left"><div class="w-layout-vflex testimonial_card-bottom_left_img-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df120e14d75d596554f42_Matthew%20Goetz.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df120e14d75d596554f42_Matthew%20Goetz-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df120e14d75d596554f42_Matthew%20Goetz.webp 800w" alt="Matthew Goetz" class="testimonial_card-bottom_left_img"/></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left-name"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Matthew Goetz</div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">CEO/Founder, BlockTower Capital</div></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_middle-line"></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right hide-mobile-landscape"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd73ceaf885fdd89983b_blocktower-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto"/></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide is-testimonial"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="display-mobile-landscape-v2"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd73bfc05787cd4e367f_maker-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex max-width-large align-center"><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium"><span class="text-color-secondary">This integration not only advances DeFi but it also brings many benefits to the MakerDAO ecosystem. By diversifying the collateral backing DAI and adding non-crypto related assets, it increases the DAI safety and makes it extremely stable. </span>This move will also help MakerDAO meet the increasing demand of DAI by tapping in a multi trillion-dollar asset class.</p></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left"><div class="w-layout-vflex testimonial_card-bottom_left_img-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df120fd99daed04d761d6_Se%CC%81bastien%20Derivaux.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Sebastien Derivaux" class="testimonial_card-bottom_left_img"/></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left-name"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Sébastien Derivaux</div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">MakerDAO</div></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_middle-line"></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right hide-mobile-landscape"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd73bfc05787cd4e367f_maker-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto logo-maker"/></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide is-testimonial"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="display-mobile-landscape-v2"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bdf4c62c9d3e38946495_parafi-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex max-width-large align-center"><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium"><span class="text-color-secondary">The Centrifuge team is a leader in real-world asset tokenization, taking a deeply thoughtful approach to design decisions around legal, regulatory, and smart contract architecture. </span>We believe we&#x27;re reaching an inflection point in institutional adoption and are excited to double down with the Centrifuge team.</p></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left"><div class="w-layout-vflex testimonial_card-bottom_left_img-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df1204cea1b3420d84cf0_Ben%20Forman.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df1204cea1b3420d84cf0_Ben%20Forman-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df1204cea1b3420d84cf0_Ben%20Forman.webp 758w" alt="Ben Forman" class="testimonial_card-bottom_left_img"/></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left-name"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Ben Forman</div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Founder and Managing Partner, ParaFi Capital</div></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_middle-line"></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right hide-mobile-landscape"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bdf4c62c9d3e38946495_parafi-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto logo-parafi"/></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide is-testimonial"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="display-mobile-landscape-v2"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd7317f56773fc639cb5_green_field-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex max-width-large align-center"><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium"><span class="text-color-secondary">We firmly believe that Centrifuge is poised to claim significant portions of this market. Having pioneered their category, the team demonstrates unwavering resilience through many years of commitment across several market cycles. </span>Their expertise in navigating the intricacies of integrating real-world assets into decentralized finance is unparalleled.</p></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left"><div class="w-layout-vflex testimonial_card-bottom_left_img-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df120fb2e23ee21e9648e_Felix%20Machart.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df120fb2e23ee21e9648e_Felix%20Machart-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df120fb2e23ee21e9648e_Felix%20Machart.webp 675w" alt="Felix Machart" class="testimonial_card-bottom_left_img"/></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left-name"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Felix Machart</div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Partner, Greenfield Capital</div></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_middle-line"></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right hide-mobile-landscape"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd7317f56773fc639cb5_green_field-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto logo-greenfield"/></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide is-testimonial"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="display-mobile-landscape-v2"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd73ac2e925f2cca6b82_aave-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex max-width-large align-center"><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">The RWA Market is a much needed building block not only for protocols such as Aave, but across DeFi as a whole. <span class="text-color-secondary">Knocking down barriers of entry and making DeFi accessible to all is part of the Aave Companies’ vision, and we are excited to be fulfilling this through the collateralization of real-world assets, made possible by Centrifuge.</span></p></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom"><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left"><div class="w-layout-vflex testimonial_card-bottom_left_img-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df1208d552313d27c70d4_Stani%20Kulechov.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df1208d552313d27c70d4_Stani%20Kulechov-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/674df1208d552313d27c70d4_Stani%20Kulechov.webp 640w" alt="Stani Kulechov" class="testimonial_card-bottom_left_img"/></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_left-name"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Stani Kulechev</div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Founder, Aave</div></div></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_middle-line"></div><div class="testimonial_card-bottom_right hide-mobile-landscape"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6706324b4c48131ee537ff96/67d2bd73ac2e925f2cca6b82_aave-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-auto logo-aave"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><a aria-label="Go to the previous slide" href="#" class="testimonial_button swiper-prev w-inline-block"><div class="icon-embed-xsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
