  </g>
</svg></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Build on Centrifuge</div></div><div class="home-why_top-content"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">Tokenize your assets with Centrifuge</h2><p class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary"><span class="text-color-primary">Bring any real-world asset onchain with Centrifuge’s automated infrastructure. </span>Streamline origination, reporting, and lifecycle management while accessing global liquidity through a transparent, compliant framework.</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid asset-benefit_item-list is-1-col"><div id="w-node-_9e100cea-42c7-cd8d-8564-a6bd1abc6f69-e537ffd6" class="layout7_item"><div class="icon-embed-xsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
  <mask id="mask0_9304_540" style="mask-type:alpha" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="0" y="-1" width="24" height="25">
    <rect y="-0.000976562" width="24" height="24" fill="#D9D9D9"/>
